# Deprecated legacy tabs

These UI areas are **legacy and unmaintained** (ADR 0005). They may still open from the「更多」menu, but **do not add features, refactors, or bugfix scope** there unless the user explicitly asks to revive them:

- `scan` — 极速形态每日扫描大 PK
- `backtest` — 回测
- `templates` — 模板

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — new capability on a deprecated tab
if (activeTab === 'scan') { /* add new filter UI */ }

// ✅ GOOD — work on maintained surfaces
// boll_pattern | stock_view | settings
```

Default new chart/period/indicator work goes to **布林编排** and **个股走势** only. If a change would touch deprecated tab code only to keep it compiling, keep the diff minimal and do not improve that UX.
